                                "sense_id": "62d98c6d-7a62-3b31-a97b-1bd1878402ed",
                                "text": "Johann Jakob Froberger's piece Canzona V in G is in the mixolydian mode."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "556abb33-64bf-464e-829f-ed55b3e61963",
                                "sense_id": "62d98c6d-7a62-3b31-a97b-1bd1878402ed",
                                "text": "It is susceptible of nodes or modes as far apart as hyperphrygian and mixolydian and of texts so divergent as priests haihooping round David's that is Circe's or what am I saying Ceres' altar and David's tip from the stable to his chief bassoonist about the alrightiness of his almightiness."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
